OL,3,GNEWSACivil servant admits he 'made
OL,4,Amistakes' juggling five government jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe civil servant accused of
OL,7,Ffraudulently earning more than #284,000
OL,8,Fby juggling multiple public-sector jobs
OL,9,Fadmitted making mistakes but said ''I
OL,10,Fdo not believe there was criminal
OL,11,Fintent".
OL,13,FGiving evidence at Southwark Crown
OL,14,FCourt, Kashim Chowdhury told the jury
OL,15,Fhe had made mistakes because he was
OL,16,F''overwhelmed and stressed'' and had
OL,17,Ffelt ''terror and panic'' at the
OL,18,Fthought of losing his livelihood.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
