OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACivil servant admits he 'made
OL,4,Amistakes' juggling five government jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe told the jury he had been diagnosed
OL,7,Fwith post-traumatic stress disorder in
OL,8,F2015 and that it had been triggered in
OL,9,F2021.
OL,11,FThe 55-year-old, who is from east
OL,12,FLondon, is on trial accused of nine
OL,13,Fcounts of fraud. He denies acting
OL,14,Fdishonestly or intending to make a
OL,15,Fdishonest gain.
